Tiles de suelo y paredes (PNG, 64x32 isometrico 2:1).

Mapeo room_id -> tile (placeholder en StudioPatterns.tsx hoy):
- reception -> tile_paper
- drawing_room -> tile_wood
- normative_library -> tile_wood_dark
- accounting_office -> tile_wood
- main_office -> tile_stone
- meeting_room -> tile_stone
- site_terrace -> tile_concrete
- trades_workshop -> tile_wood
- archive -> tile_wood_dark
- urgency_corridor -> tile_urgency

Cuando lleguen los assets se cargan via Pixi Assets.load() y se sustituye
StudioPatterns.tsx por Tilemap real.
